cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use mmdance, please cite it as below."
title: "mmdance: MMD dances on any Mixamo-rigged Blender character"
abstract: >-
  A headless, config-driven Blender pipeline that retargets MikuMikuDance (MMD) VMD dance motion,
  camera and facial tracks onto Mixamo-rigged characters (Tripo, Meshy, Mixamo, AccuRig or custom
  rigs), simulates and bakes skirt and hair physics, animates faces through shape keys or
  painted-face expression atlases, builds a stage, renders with EEVEE and encodes the video with
  the song.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Liu
    given-names: Yangyi
repository-code: "https://github.com/starryark/mmdance"
url: "https://starryark.github.io/mmdance/"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-26"
keywords:
  - MMD
  - MikuMikuDance
  - VMD
  - Blender
  - Mixamo
  - motion retargeting
  - character animation
  - cloth simulation
  - facial animation
  - Tripo
  - Meshy
